11
01:10:53,333 --> 01:10:59,333
The film stars Powell, Adria Arjona, Austin Amelio, Retta, and Sanjay Rao.

12
01:17:20,000 --> 01:17:26,000
It follows an undercover New Orleans police contractor who poses as a
reliable hitman as he tries to save a woman in need.

13
01:23:46,666 --> 01:23:52,666
The basic premise was based on the true story of a college professor who worked for the Houston police in the late
1980s and 1990s as a fake hitman, as described in a 2001 magazine article by Skip Hollandsworth.

14
01:30:13,333 --> 01:30:19,333
Hit Man premiered at the 80th Venice International
Film Festival on September 5, 2023.

15
01:36:40,000 --> 01:36:46,000
It was released in select theaters in the United States on May 24, 2024, before
its streaming debut by Netflix on June 7, to critical acclaim.

16
01:43:06,666 --> 01:43:12,666
The film explores themes of hitman, identity,
professor, new orleans, louisiana, romcom.

